1
00:00:00,375 --> 00:00:01,415
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

2
00:00:01,415 --> 00:00:02,515
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

3
00:00:02,515 --> 00:00:03,615
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

4
00:00:05,715 --> 00:00:07,485
(Episode 18)

5
00:00:14,285 --> 00:00:15,625
We should stop here.

6
00:00:17,225 --> 00:00:18,825
They say you shouldn't take...

7
00:00:21,025 --> 00:00:22,135
a path with an obvious end.

8
00:00:23,235 --> 00:00:25,235
If I confused you and messed with your feelings,

9
00:00:27,565 --> 00:00:30,735
knowing I couldn't even make it to the end...

10
00:00:33,005 --> 00:00:35,275
and being too much of a coward to try,

11
00:00:38,885 --> 00:00:39,915
then for that,

12
00:00:42,385 --> 00:00:43,655
I'm so, so sorry.

13
00:00:52,865 --> 00:00:54,395
I need to see how this ends, Gyu Rim.

14
00:00:57,965 --> 00:01:00,365
Even if I get hurt, you get hurt,

15
00:01:01,265 --> 00:01:02,935
and someone else gets hurt,

16
00:01:03,205 --> 00:01:04,635
I just have to see...

17
00:01:05,645 --> 00:01:08,175
what happens to us in the end.

18
00:01:28,265 --> 00:01:29,265
Mom.

19
00:01:33,705 --> 00:01:34,875
Mom.

20
00:01:35,575 --> 00:01:36,575
Yes, son.

21
00:01:36,975 --> 00:01:38,975
I hung up all the Runaway Apology Kits.

22
00:01:39,575 --> 00:01:41,675
I was not going to hang one on Aunt Gyu Young's door,

23
00:01:42,275 --> 00:01:43,775
but I just did it anyway.

24
00:01:44,475 --> 00:01:45,785
You did a good job.

25
00:01:46,385 --> 00:01:48,755
Our Gyeol is a real brave man.

26
00:01:49,855 --> 00:01:51,455
You did great, my baby.

27
00:01:53,555 --> 00:01:56,895
What? Hey, what is this?

28
00:01:57,355 --> 00:01:59,295
- What is it? - It is a Runaway Apology Kit.

29
00:01:59,365 --> 00:02:01,165
Hey, what is that?

30
00:02:01,795 --> 00:02:03,595
It is a kit to apologize for running away.

31
00:02:05,005 --> 00:02:06,335
An errand coupon?

32
00:02:06,735 --> 00:02:09,475
Hey, so I can make you run errands with this coupon?

33
00:02:09,535 --> 00:02:11,545
Yes, you can ask for a massage.

34
00:02:11,605 --> 00:02:13,475
You can also ask me to shine your shoes.

35
00:02:14,075 --> 00:02:15,515
Hey, give me another one then.

36
00:02:15,575 --> 00:02:18,015
No. It is one kit per person.

37
00:02:18,645 --> 00:02:21,285
Hey, giving just one is not very affectionate.

38
00:02:21,445 --> 00:02:25,255
- Hey, you will be cursed in death. - I will give you my gummies, Dad.

39
00:02:25,655 --> 00:02:29,125
Gosh. I will give you all my gummies.

40
00:02:30,325 --> 00:02:34,525
Here, the errand coupon is confiscated.

41
00:02:34,595 --> 00:02:35,995
What did we even do right...

42
00:02:36,065 --> 00:02:38,205
to try and exploit child labour?

43
00:02:40,065 --> 00:02:42,935
- Oh, come on. - I will just take this, too,

44
00:02:44,275 --> 00:02:45,805
- and return the errand coupon. - Here.

45
00:02:46,775 --> 00:02:49,615
Hey, what does that make me if you guys act like this?

46
00:02:49,675 --> 00:02:52,485
It is okay, Dad. You can just consistently be...

47
00:02:52,545 --> 00:02:55,115
- the immature grandfather. - What?

48
00:02:56,455 --> 00:02:59,425
- You brats, seriously. - You look perfectly fine, though?

49
00:02:59,825 --> 00:03:02,295
I thought your mom hugged you so tight that she popped you.

50
00:03:04,095 --> 00:03:05,425
I was going to pop him,

51
00:03:05,495 --> 00:03:06,765
but I let him off because he is too precious.

52
00:03:07,795 --> 00:03:08,895
Then...

53
00:03:10,095 --> 00:03:13,905
The youngest uncle should hug him tight and pop him.

54
00:03:13,965 --> 00:03:17,435
- Me too, me too, our Gyeol. - Gosh, be quiet!

55
00:03:18,645 --> 00:03:22,075
What is this eerie feeling that I am the only one left out?

56
00:03:23,175 --> 00:03:25,945
Today is a special day, so let's eat together.

57
00:03:26,485 --> 00:03:27,885
- Really? - Fried rice is fine, right?

58
00:03:27,885 --> 00:03:29,685
- Yes. - I want to eat black bean rice.

59
00:03:29,685 --> 00:03:31,155
Gosh, wait a minute!

60
00:03:31,415 --> 00:03:32,655
What is it?

61
00:03:35,395 --> 00:03:38,225
- Yes! - Why, what is it?

62
00:03:38,295 --> 00:03:39,765
Mr. Mu Jin.

63
00:03:41,765 --> 00:03:45,635
Mom, Mr. Mu Jin said he pulled a rare Powermon card...

64
00:03:45,705 --> 00:03:47,965
and will leave it in the milk pouch for me.

65
00:03:48,305 --> 00:03:51,335
Hey, who is Mr. Mu Jin?

66
00:03:51,405 --> 00:03:53,575
A man that Mom and I really like.

67
00:03:58,515 --> 00:04:00,415
A man...

68
00:04:00,485 --> 00:04:01,485
A man?

69
00:04:21,435 --> 00:04:23,575
- Mister. - Gyeol.

70
00:04:24,135 --> 00:04:27,375
Did you really pull a rare Powermon card?

71
00:04:27,805 --> 00:04:28,875
Look.

72
00:04:32,745 --> 00:04:33,745
It is real.

73
00:04:37,015 --> 00:04:38,725
Hey. You.

74
00:04:39,885 --> 00:04:41,255
You, wait a minute.

75
00:04:45,325 --> 00:04:46,825
You. Gosh.

76
00:04:48,165 --> 00:04:50,735
- I definitely know your face. - Yes.

77
00:04:51,935 --> 00:04:53,265
It has been a while, sir.

78
00:04:53,765 --> 00:04:54,805
Sir?

79
00:04:55,705 --> 00:04:56,705
You.

80
00:05:03,115 --> 00:05:04,275
It's a knockoff.

81
00:05:06,745 --> 00:05:07,785
Then...

82
00:05:08,655 --> 00:05:11,115
The belt and the shoes...

83
00:05:11,185 --> 00:05:13,855
Are they all knockoffs, then?

84
00:05:14,025 --> 00:05:17,655
You're that guy. The knockoff, right?

85
00:05:18,695 --> 00:05:21,125
Gosh, yes, that's right.

86
00:05:21,195 --> 00:05:24,895
I am telling you this now, but they were not knockoffs.

87
00:05:25,535 --> 00:05:26,835
They were real?

88
00:05:27,165 --> 00:05:28,165
Yes.

89
00:05:29,205 --> 00:05:31,135
- Hey. Just come inside first. - Should I go out?

90
00:05:31,135 --> 00:05:34,805
Yes, go out. What if Dad makes a mistake with him?

91
00:05:36,975 --> 00:05:38,245
Me?

92
00:05:38,315 --> 00:05:40,945
Who else is here besides you?

93
00:05:41,315 --> 00:05:42,915
Hey, let's go inside and talk. Come in.

94
00:05:42,915 --> 00:05:46,255
Gosh, well, sir. I just stopped by while exercising in sweatpants.

95
00:05:46,325 --> 00:05:47,955
I will go home, change my clothes, and come right back.

96
00:05:48,085 --> 00:05:50,995
Did I say anything about your sweatpants?

97
00:05:51,055 --> 00:05:53,325
Let's go inside and talk first. Just come in.

98
00:05:53,965 --> 00:05:55,135
Just come in.

99
00:05:56,595 --> 00:05:58,065
Come inside.

100
00:05:58,365 --> 00:06:00,565
Gyeol, I was going to shower after exercising,

101
00:06:00,635 --> 00:06:01,875
so I came out without washing up today.

102
00:06:01,875 --> 00:06:03,135
I did not even wash my face,

103
00:06:03,605 --> 00:06:05,405
and my hair is a mess from yesterday. Is that okay?

104
00:06:05,605 --> 00:06:08,175
It is okay. You are so handsome...

105
00:06:08,175 --> 00:06:10,015
that it doesn't even show that you did not wash your face.

106
00:06:11,985 --> 00:06:13,515
What are you still doing out here?

107
00:06:13,585 --> 00:06:16,155
- I am trying to go in. - Come in.

108
00:06:22,525 --> 00:06:25,055
Hey. Come in.

109
00:06:25,125 --> 00:06:28,465
Everyone, gather up. Hey, come in.

110
00:06:28,535 --> 00:06:30,635
Hey, Gyu Rim. Now, everyone gather around.

111
00:06:31,265 --> 00:06:35,275
- Wow, I was watching secretly. - Hello.

112
00:06:35,275 --> 00:06:37,005
Welcome.

113
00:06:37,075 --> 00:06:38,205
What is this, you guys?

114
00:06:38,905 --> 00:06:40,045
Do you all know each other?

115
00:06:40,105 --> 00:06:43,715
Yes. I am going to show Woo Ram my rare Powermon card.

116
00:06:45,345 --> 00:06:46,415
What?

117
00:06:46,815 --> 00:06:50,015
So you all know each other except for me? What?

118
00:06:50,455 --> 00:06:51,715
I am the only outcast here, is that it?

119
00:06:51,785 --> 00:06:53,325
Gosh, we did not leave you out on purpose.

120
00:06:53,625 --> 00:06:57,025
- Do not keep feeling insecure, Dad. - Well...

121
00:06:59,125 --> 00:07:02,335
Since you are seated, I will formally introduce myself.

122
00:07:02,935 --> 00:07:04,835
Gosh, why would I accept your greeting?

123
00:07:04,895 --> 00:07:06,035
Who are you?

124
00:07:06,105 --> 00:07:09,375
What, are you seeing our Gyu Rim again or something?

125
00:07:13,545 --> 00:07:15,445
I like your daughter very much.

126
00:07:15,715 --> 00:07:16,915
Of course, Gyu Rim...

127
00:07:16,975 --> 00:07:18,845
has not accepted my feelings yet.

128
00:07:19,185 --> 00:07:21,585
So I was hoping you could...

129
00:07:21,645 --> 00:07:23,155
help me out a little, sir.

130
00:07:23,215 --> 00:07:24,855
No, why would I help a guy like you?

131
00:07:24,855 --> 00:07:27,155
Why? A penniless knockoff like you.

132
00:07:27,225 --> 00:07:30,225
- How dare you covet my daughter? - Dad.

133
00:07:31,425 --> 00:07:34,395
I will not deny that I am coveting your beautiful daughter.

134
00:07:34,465 --> 00:07:38,805
But that watch, belt, and shoes, they were not knockoffs.

135
00:07:38,865 --> 00:07:41,735
- I am telling you once again... - He is not penniless, Dad.

136
00:07:42,005 --> 00:07:43,175
He is the Chef...

137
00:07:43,235 --> 00:07:44,705
and CEO of the restaurant where I work part-time.

138
00:07:45,405 --> 00:07:47,805
Gosh, you are a restaurant CEO?

139
00:07:48,515 --> 00:07:50,045
I am a co-CEO with a friend.

140
00:07:50,615 --> 00:07:54,085
A co-CEO? Of some tiny little restaurant?

141
00:07:54,145 --> 00:07:55,145
It is huge, Father.

142
00:07:55,215 --> 00:07:57,715
It is a very famous restaurant that everyone knows.

143
00:07:57,785 --> 00:08:01,925
Oh. Okay. Then do you own your home?

144
00:08:02,655 --> 00:08:04,295
- Well... - Father.

145
00:08:05,265 --> 00:08:06,625
I don't own it.

146
00:08:06,895 --> 00:08:09,835
It is a mix of a deposit and monthly rent...

147
00:08:09,895 --> 00:08:12,735
What have you been doing at your age without buying a house?

148
00:08:12,805 --> 00:08:16,035
- Luxury watches, belts, shoes? - Father.

149
00:08:16,505 --> 00:08:17,875
My savings account matures next year.

150
00:08:17,935 --> 00:08:19,845
And I will recover the money I invested here and there.

151
00:08:19,905 --> 00:08:21,445
Then if I sell some stocks...

152
00:08:21,505 --> 00:08:25,075
and get a small loan, I think I can buy a small apartment.

153
00:08:25,285 --> 00:08:27,315
- Mu Jin, let's go outside. - Hey.

154
00:08:27,385 --> 00:08:29,355
You don't have a screw loose, do you?

155
00:08:30,115 --> 00:08:33,185
I was listening from upstairs, and you don't seem quite normal.

156
00:08:33,825 --> 00:08:36,755
Gyu Rim is not rich, she doesn't have amazing skills,

157
00:08:36,855 --> 00:08:38,895
and she is a single mother with a son, so why are you so desperate?

158
00:08:39,295 --> 00:08:41,795
Oh, did you get a divorce in the meantime?

159
00:08:41,935 --> 00:08:43,295
How many kids do you have?

160
00:08:44,035 --> 00:08:47,065
Wow, I thought you would have gotten a little nicer by now,

161
00:08:47,565 --> 00:08:49,075
but you are still as mean as ever.

162
00:08:49,375 --> 00:08:51,805
What? This guy is talking down to me again.

163
00:08:51,875 --> 00:08:53,545
If you are offended, you can drop the formalities too.

164
00:08:53,905 --> 00:08:55,515
Oh my. What a jerk.

165
00:08:55,715 --> 00:08:57,875
Whatever. Ruin your own life for all I care.

166
00:08:59,215 --> 00:09:01,145
Hey, Gyu Rim, didn't I tell you not to trust people?

167
00:09:01,215 --> 00:09:02,985
Especially men, I told you not to trust them, right?

168
00:09:03,055 --> 00:09:04,755
Do you have to learn the hard way to come to your senses?

169
00:09:05,115 --> 00:09:07,485
Go ahead and get burned really badly then.

170
00:09:07,955 --> 00:09:09,955
Wow, your words... We have not met in a long...

171
00:09:13,325 --> 00:09:15,835
You must have had a hard time because of her.

172
00:09:17,135 --> 00:09:19,235
How can I even express how hard and upsetting it is...

173
00:09:20,505 --> 00:09:21,765
- No, but you... - Yes.

174
00:09:21,765 --> 00:09:24,905
Have you been after our Gyu Rim for eight years, until now?

175
00:09:25,705 --> 00:09:29,375
Or, like Gyu Young said, did you go somewhere, take a break,

176
00:09:29,445 --> 00:09:30,775
and come back to hit on her again?

177
00:09:30,845 --> 00:09:32,785
Personally, I did not really take a break.

178
00:09:33,145 --> 00:09:35,085
- Mu Jin, let's go outside. - Why?

179
00:09:35,085 --> 00:09:37,055
- Let's go. - I'm talking with him right now.

180
00:09:37,115 --> 00:09:39,625
I will formally introduce myself next time, dressed nicely.

181
00:09:40,185 --> 00:09:44,025
Hey, no, hey, tracksuit. I am not done talking yet.

182
00:09:44,525 --> 00:09:46,365
You're so pathetic, seriously.

183
00:09:52,435 --> 00:09:55,005
Why are you responding to every single nonsensical thing?

184
00:09:56,275 --> 00:09:57,435
Well, he could be curious.

185
00:09:57,505 --> 00:09:59,005
From your father's perspective, of course.

186
00:10:01,305 --> 00:10:03,475
Gosh, I still should have dressed up to greet him.

187
00:10:04,315 --> 00:10:06,015
What if I got on your father's bad side again?

188
00:10:06,715 --> 00:10:08,045
Do not do this, Mu Jin.

189
00:10:09,455 --> 00:10:12,285
You and I are not meant to be.

190
00:10:13,325 --> 00:10:15,755
- We can't work out, really. - Why?

191
00:10:17,295 --> 00:10:19,465
Why are we not meant to be, and why can we not work out?

192
00:10:22,735 --> 00:10:24,995
- You ask because you don't know? - I don't know.

193
00:10:25,835 --> 00:10:26,965
I am a single mother.

194
00:10:27,035 --> 00:10:29,705
- That is solved if you marry me. - Mu Jin.

195
00:10:30,205 --> 00:10:33,975
Even to Gyeol, I might not be a wonderful father,

196
00:10:34,045 --> 00:10:35,515
but I can be a good...

197
00:10:35,945 --> 00:10:36,945
No.

198
00:10:37,875 --> 00:10:39,885
A good father, a wonderful father, a handsome father,

199
00:10:39,885 --> 00:10:40,885
I can be all of that.

200
00:10:40,945 --> 00:10:43,985
Go grab anyone passing by and ask them...

201
00:10:44,315 --> 00:10:47,525
if it makes sense for a guy like you to like a woman like me.

202
00:10:48,225 --> 00:10:50,195
I am telling you that you are the only one for me,

203
00:10:50,255 --> 00:10:52,095
and that I absolutely can't live without you,

204
00:10:52,165 --> 00:10:53,965
so why would I ask people passing by?

205
00:10:55,865 --> 00:10:58,165
And why are you speaking so harshly?

206
00:10:58,435 --> 00:11:00,735
Do you know how precious and...

207
00:11:01,105 --> 00:11:02,475
valuable Gyu Rim is to me?

208
00:11:02,475 --> 00:11:03,575
Why do you get to define...

209
00:11:03,635 --> 00:11:05,875
and degrade yourself however you want?

210
00:11:05,945 --> 00:11:07,275
If you say something like that one more time,

211
00:11:07,345 --> 00:11:08,645
I will sue you for defamation...

212
00:11:15,555 --> 00:11:17,185
I can't even report you because you are too pretty.

213
00:11:19,985 --> 00:11:23,095
Anyway, I didn't even wash my face today,

214
00:11:23,155 --> 00:11:25,495
and I don't look good right now.

215
00:11:25,495 --> 00:11:26,795
My hair is the same as yesterday,

216
00:11:27,195 --> 00:11:28,525
so I can't see you for long today.

217
00:11:28,525 --> 00:11:31,435
Next time, I will get ready and look nice,

218
00:11:31,495 --> 00:11:33,205
and let's meet again. Gyu Rim, okay?

219
00:11:34,805 --> 00:11:35,835
Bye.

220
00:11:48,545 --> 00:11:50,015
Mu Jin is not here.

221
00:12:14,275 --> 00:12:17,515
Did Mu Jin go to Han Gyu Rim?

222
00:12:17,575 --> 00:12:19,745
Whether he went or not, what does it matter to you?

223
00:12:20,545 --> 00:12:21,545
Gyu Rim...

224
00:12:23,115 --> 00:12:24,915
came before you, originally.

225
00:12:26,185 --> 00:12:28,895
- Jung Woo. - For eight years, Mu Jin...

226
00:12:29,625 --> 00:12:31,995
never forgot Gyu Rim for a single moment.

227
00:12:32,925 --> 00:12:35,265
He was never swayed by another woman, including you,

228
00:12:35,595 --> 00:12:37,735
- not even for one second. - Jung Woo.

229
00:12:37,735 --> 00:12:39,405
Kim Mu Jin is completely devoted.

230
00:12:40,535 --> 00:12:41,805
Did you not know?

231
00:12:42,405 --> 00:12:43,475
You knew.

232
00:12:44,605 --> 00:12:48,345
That he came to you an empty shell, out of guilt and responsibility,

233
00:12:49,375 --> 00:12:51,045
you knew that better than anyone.

234
00:12:51,345 --> 00:12:53,645
Stop it. Who said I wanted to talk to you?

235
00:12:53,715 --> 00:12:54,885
Mu Jin did...

236
00:12:56,585 --> 00:12:57,985
everything he could for you,

237
00:12:59,155 --> 00:13:01,355
and he did his absolute best without anyone being able to say otherwise.

238
00:13:02,925 --> 00:13:04,925
If you decided to break up, make it a clean break.

239
00:13:05,295 --> 00:13:06,365
Stop whining.

240
00:13:29,455 --> 00:13:31,455
Seo Hyun knows that you are not the Chairman's son,

241
00:13:31,515 --> 00:13:35,155
and that Gyu Rim is Yoon Hee's biological daughter.

242
00:13:40,225 --> 00:13:41,265
She thinks that...

243
00:13:42,465 --> 00:13:45,465
even you and I deceived and mocked her,

244
00:13:45,865 --> 00:13:47,665
so she is going crazy from anger and feeling wronged right now.

245
00:13:57,375 --> 00:13:58,915
She is actually being mild.

246
00:13:59,385 --> 00:14:00,445
If I were Seo Hyun,

247
00:14:02,115 --> 00:14:03,715
I would have killed either you or me.

248
00:14:33,645 --> 00:14:34,715
Take it back.

249
00:14:37,555 --> 00:14:38,885
I am not going to let you go.

250
00:14:41,925 --> 00:14:43,755
I take back telling you to go to Han Gyu Rim.

251
00:14:44,195 --> 00:14:45,765
You played foul first.

252
00:14:49,795 --> 00:14:51,095
So what if you are just an empty shell?

253
00:14:52,605 --> 00:14:53,965
I am not giving you to Han Gyu Rim.

254
00:15:01,275 --> 00:15:02,645
Why?

255
00:15:02,715 --> 00:15:05,615
Why are you not saying anything? Just say something.

256
00:15:09,855 --> 00:15:10,855
I have nothing to say.

257
00:15:14,085 --> 00:15:15,085
Mu Jin.

258
00:15:18,695 --> 00:15:21,725
Even if I had ten mouths, I would have nothing to say to you.

259
00:15:23,795 --> 00:15:25,035
Kim Mu Jin.

260
00:15:29,205 --> 00:15:30,235
I am sorry, Seo Hyun.

261
00:15:33,305 --> 00:15:36,345
I will make sure to be punished for giving you a hard time.

262
00:16:10,075 --> 00:16:11,175
You bought insurance, right?

263
00:16:14,415 --> 00:16:16,315
Did that jerk not make you sign up for life insurance?

264
00:16:16,785 --> 00:16:18,015
What are you talking about now?

265
00:16:19,025 --> 00:16:21,955
Do not tell me you guys already registered your marriage.

266
00:16:23,425 --> 00:16:24,455
Do I look like you?

267
00:16:29,365 --> 00:16:30,495
You saw the news, right?

268
00:16:30,765 --> 00:16:32,665
Registering a marriage first to collect insurance money,

269
00:16:32,805 --> 00:16:34,765
and then brutally killing them by disguising it as an accident.

270
00:16:37,075 --> 00:16:39,705
Then why are you seeing a guy you met eight years ago again?

271
00:16:39,775 --> 00:16:41,805
You are just as broke now as you were back then.

272
00:16:41,875 --> 00:16:43,515
And now you even have a kid dragging you down.

273
00:16:43,575 --> 00:16:45,445
How many insurance policies do you have?

274
00:16:46,015 --> 00:16:48,115
Should I just push you right here?

275
00:16:49,555 --> 00:16:50,915
Did you con him by any chance?

276
00:16:50,915 --> 00:16:52,985
Did you say our mom is marrying a rich man?

277
00:16:53,055 --> 00:16:55,155
Did you say if our stepfather dies, half of his fortune goes to our mom?

278
00:16:55,225 --> 00:16:57,855
Did you say you were basically a rich daughter?

279
00:16:57,925 --> 00:17:01,565
You are a lowlife because you live with thoughts like that.

280
00:17:01,625 --> 00:17:04,165
- What? A lowlife? - Yes.

281
00:17:04,235 --> 00:17:06,665
A lowlife trash with no conscience or shame.

282
00:17:06,665 --> 00:17:07,835
Hey!

283
00:17:10,705 --> 00:17:12,575
You are the one who needs to call off that marriage.

284
00:17:12,645 --> 00:17:15,815
Even now, say you committed a grave sin, apologize for deceiving them,

285
00:17:15,875 --> 00:17:17,845
beg for forgiveness, and back out.

286
00:17:17,915 --> 00:17:19,415
You really are pushing it...

287
00:17:19,815 --> 00:17:20,985
If you can't do it,

288
00:17:20,985 --> 00:17:23,085
I will get on my knees and beg for you.

289
00:17:23,985 --> 00:17:26,785
Let's do that, Gyu Young. Before it is too late, please.

290
00:17:27,055 --> 00:17:28,585
It is my life.

291
00:17:28,885 --> 00:17:30,895
You said you wanted to cut ties, so what does it matter to you?

292
00:17:31,255 --> 00:17:33,165
You know, if I could drain it out,

293
00:17:33,225 --> 00:17:35,965
I would drain all the Han blood in my body.

294
00:17:35,965 --> 00:17:37,195
Do you understand?

295
00:17:42,975 --> 00:17:45,505
Stop worrying about the highway someone worked to death to pave,

296
00:17:46,145 --> 00:17:48,545
and worry about your own bleak dirt road.

297
00:17:49,315 --> 00:17:51,445
They might poison your food,

298
00:17:51,515 --> 00:17:53,115
so make sure you carry a silver spoon around.

299
00:18:29,715 --> 00:18:32,315
He said the password was ridiculously easy.

300
00:18:32,385 --> 00:18:34,725
Do not tell me it's 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6...

301
00:18:36,295 --> 00:18:38,125
It can't be 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 0...

302
00:18:40,295 --> 00:18:41,565
Does this make any sense?

303
00:18:47,205 --> 00:18:49,305
That person's name was...

304
00:18:49,375 --> 00:18:51,035
Son Ji Yeol, right?

305
00:18:52,945 --> 00:18:54,145
Here it is.

306
00:18:54,775 --> 00:18:56,115
Zero, one, zero...

307
00:18:57,315 --> 00:18:59,715
Three, zero, five, two...

308
00:19:00,985 --> 00:19:03,715
One, seven, one, seven. Okay.

309
00:19:06,955 --> 00:19:07,955
What are you doing?

310
00:19:09,395 --> 00:19:12,255
You startled me. Don't you knock before coming in?

311
00:19:13,625 --> 00:19:15,325
Why would I knock to enter my own room?

312
00:19:16,395 --> 00:19:17,395
Right.

313
00:19:19,205 --> 00:19:20,665
What were you doing?

314
00:19:20,935 --> 00:19:22,505
Kids don't need to know.

315
00:19:23,175 --> 00:19:25,775
What is it? Gosh, what are you trying to do now?

316
00:19:26,605 --> 00:19:27,945
You looked at Gyu Oh's phone, didn't you?

317
00:19:28,845 --> 00:19:30,115
Let go.

318
00:19:30,175 --> 00:19:31,645
- Hey, you... - Gosh...

319
00:19:36,155 --> 00:19:37,185
Hey, twins.

320
00:19:39,825 --> 00:19:41,355
If you are going to fight, go outside.

321
00:19:41,955 --> 00:19:45,965
- Okay. - We were about to go. Sorry.

322
00:19:46,495 --> 00:19:47,495
Good night, Gyu Oh.

323
00:19:49,265 --> 00:19:50,265
Go.

324
00:19:56,405 --> 00:19:59,345
- Let me see your black eye. - No, I am fine. It is all healed.

325
00:19:59,705 --> 00:20:01,545
Gosh, let me see how ugly you have gotten.

326
00:20:05,175 --> 00:20:07,315
How did you manage to be a gigolo looking like this?

327
00:20:07,885 --> 00:20:11,155
- What, punk? - Did you only meet blind women?

328
00:20:11,215 --> 00:20:13,655
Gosh, darn it. What time is it?

329
00:20:14,655 --> 00:20:15,785
Are you not going to school?

330
00:20:34,605 --> 00:20:35,945
Where are you?

331
00:20:36,545 --> 00:20:37,545
Home.

332
00:20:38,975 --> 00:20:40,245
Turn your phone around.

333
00:20:44,455 --> 00:20:45,455
Wait...

334
00:20:50,695 --> 00:20:51,695
Han Gyu Seo?

335
00:20:51,755 --> 00:20:53,195
(Han Gyu Seo)

336
00:20:53,325 --> 00:20:56,265
Gosh, you must be Gyu Oh's younger brother.

337
00:20:56,735 --> 00:20:57,765
Hello.

338
00:20:59,665 --> 00:21:01,465
Oh, yes, hello.

339
00:21:01,835 --> 00:21:04,275
I am Han Gyu Oh's girlfriend, Kwon Hee Na.

340
00:21:07,145 --> 00:21:08,145
Okay.

341
00:21:10,945 --> 00:21:14,145
Anyway, why the sudden video call?

342
00:21:14,215 --> 00:21:16,485
I wanted to see your face, not just hear your voice.

343
00:21:17,315 --> 00:21:20,225
- What? - Can you put your brother back on?

344
00:21:27,925 --> 00:21:29,565
I will memorize it right away,

345
00:21:29,635 --> 00:21:31,835
so could you give me your phone number, Gyu Seo?

346
00:21:33,805 --> 00:21:35,235
Yes, it is 0, 1, 0...

347
00:21:36,675 --> 00:21:38,775
Wait, why do you need Gyu Seo's number?

348
00:21:38,835 --> 00:21:41,045
To see what you are up to when I am not looking.

349
00:21:41,105 --> 00:21:43,415
- I want him to keep an eye on you. - What?

350
00:21:44,015 --> 00:21:45,275
Here.

351
00:21:45,345 --> 00:21:48,785
It's 0, 1, 0, 0, 1, 3, 4, 1, 8, 7.

352
00:21:48,845 --> 00:21:49,855
Did you memorize it?

353
00:21:53,955 --> 00:21:55,385
Gyu Seo has to go to school.

354
00:21:56,025 --> 00:21:57,255
Let's talk later.

355
00:22:01,225 --> 00:22:03,935
- Are you not going to school? - I am.

356
00:22:43,775 --> 00:22:46,175
- Hello, this is Han Gyu Seo. - This is Kwon Hee Na.

357
00:22:46,245 --> 00:22:48,145
From the video call earlier.

358
00:22:48,205 --> 00:22:49,205
Yes.

359
00:22:50,775 --> 00:22:52,475
Let's get along well from now on.

360
00:22:53,785 --> 00:22:57,185
You will see when we meet, but I am a teacher.

361
00:22:57,255 --> 00:22:59,115
And I am a really, really good person.

362
00:22:59,725 --> 00:23:01,385
How long have you been seeing my brother?

363
00:23:01,925 --> 00:23:03,225
Yesterday was day one.

364
00:23:04,025 --> 00:23:06,425
By any chance, how much do you know about my brother?

365
00:23:08,525 --> 00:23:10,165
How much do I need to know?

366
00:23:13,505 --> 00:23:15,405
I don't care about his past.

367
00:23:15,965 --> 00:23:17,875
Why should I care what he did before he met me,

368
00:23:17,875 --> 00:23:19,505
what kind of women he dated,

369
00:23:19,875 --> 00:23:22,175
or what kind of jobs he had?

370
00:23:23,215 --> 00:23:27,085
I just need to know Han Gyu Oh from now on.

371
00:23:27,515 --> 00:23:30,985
What shampoo he uses, what food he likes,

372
00:23:31,385 --> 00:23:35,555
if he snores when he sleeps, and what his shoe size is.

373
00:23:36,085 --> 00:23:39,695
Could you help me with my research on Han Gyu Oh, Gyu Seo?

374
00:23:41,165 --> 00:23:42,165
Of course.

375
00:23:44,695 --> 00:23:48,065
Then could I ask you for one favour as well?

376
00:23:49,975 --> 00:23:50,975
Of course.

377
00:23:52,375 --> 00:23:54,105
No matter what kind of person my brother is,

378
00:23:55,475 --> 00:23:57,815
or even if he happens to disappoint you,

379
00:23:58,475 --> 00:23:59,845
please don't abandon him.

380
00:24:01,485 --> 00:24:03,715
You said you are a really, really good person.

381
00:24:03,915 --> 00:24:05,685
Since you are a teacher and an educator,

382
00:24:06,085 --> 00:24:08,355
just think of it as teaching a lesson to a lacking student.

383
00:24:09,925 --> 00:24:12,025
All right. I will never abandon him.

384
00:24:12,695 --> 00:24:14,325
If he tries to fly away and leave me,

385
00:24:14,595 --> 00:24:17,465
I will snap his legs and keep him by my side,

386
00:24:17,535 --> 00:24:18,895
so don't worry.

387
00:24:25,275 --> 00:24:26,645
(Grandmother Su Nam)

388
00:24:37,555 --> 00:24:39,255
(Grandmother Su Nam)

389
00:24:42,655 --> 00:24:46,425
Gyu Oh, why are you calling so early in the morning?

390
00:24:46,795 --> 00:24:49,865
Did something happen to your sister?

391
00:24:51,335 --> 00:24:52,695
You know Kwon Hee Na, right, Grandmother?

392
00:24:53,805 --> 00:24:55,665
Could I get her parents' contact information?

393
00:24:56,935 --> 00:24:59,645
Why do you need Hee Na's parents' contact information?

394
00:25:01,405 --> 00:25:03,845
Did something happen to Hee Na?

395
00:25:05,415 --> 00:25:07,185
There is this thug.

396
00:25:08,385 --> 00:25:09,445
That punk doesn't know his place...

397
00:25:09,515 --> 00:25:11,455
and seems to like Kwon Hee Na way too much.

398
00:25:13,085 --> 00:25:15,855
Kwon Hee Na is too soft and doesn't know how scary the world is.

399
00:25:17,955 --> 00:25:19,825
Before things get out of hand,

400
00:25:20,395 --> 00:25:21,695
her parents need to come...

401
00:25:22,865 --> 00:25:24,895
and scold that punk to get him away from her.

402
00:25:25,395 --> 00:25:29,005
What kind of nonsense are you spouting?

403
00:25:29,535 --> 00:25:32,205
Who is this rotten thug anyway?

404
00:25:32,835 --> 00:25:34,345
There is no need to involve her parents.

405
00:25:34,405 --> 00:25:38,775
I am practically her parent. Tell me who that guy is.

406
00:25:38,845 --> 00:25:42,085
I will go to him right now and smash his head in.

407
00:25:42,285 --> 00:25:44,315
I said, who is he?

408
00:25:44,385 --> 00:25:46,525
Give me his name and address right now.

409
00:25:47,185 --> 00:25:48,325
What is it?

410
00:25:51,225 --> 00:25:52,255
I am sorry.

411
00:25:54,125 --> 00:25:55,525
I will tell you later.

412
00:26:10,545 --> 00:26:14,085
Hey, hey, hey, Gyu Oh. Hey, you punk.

413
00:26:14,145 --> 00:26:16,355
- Oh, seriously. - What?

414
00:26:16,815 --> 00:26:18,255
Did he learn from his sisters...

415
00:26:18,315 --> 00:26:22,025
how to drive people crazy or something?

416
00:26:22,085 --> 00:26:24,625
- What? - Why did he hang up?

417
00:26:24,695 --> 00:26:26,255
What did Gyu Oh say? What is going on?

418
00:26:26,255 --> 00:26:30,935
Some crazy jerk is completely obsessed with Hee Na,

419
00:26:30,995 --> 00:26:33,835
and he says the parents need to step in and stop him.

420
00:26:34,465 --> 00:26:38,335
Who is that crazy jerk? Is it someone Gyu Oh knows?

421
00:26:38,905 --> 00:26:41,945
No. You stay out of this.

422
00:26:42,805 --> 00:26:45,275
If you throw another punch over someone else's business,

423
00:26:45,345 --> 00:26:47,585
what did I say I would do?

424
00:26:47,645 --> 00:26:48,985
That you would wrap me up...

425
00:26:48,985 --> 00:26:50,755
- in your skirt... - Yes.

426
00:26:50,815 --> 00:26:53,955
- and dive into the Han River. - That is right. Yes.

427
00:26:54,025 --> 00:26:57,655
The day you do that, we are both dead.

428
00:26:57,725 --> 00:26:59,125
- Got it? - I know.

429
00:27:00,965 --> 00:27:05,165
But how does Gyu Oh know so much about Hee Na?

430
00:27:05,735 --> 00:27:08,565
Have they been keeping in touch and meeting up?

431
00:27:09,935 --> 00:27:13,445
- Hey. - Why eavesdrop on my soliloquy?

432
00:27:13,505 --> 00:27:14,905
Are we strangers?

433
00:27:17,375 --> 00:27:19,845
By the way, we are having raw fish for lunch,

434
00:27:19,915 --> 00:27:21,415
so let's just eat something light for breakfast.

435
00:27:21,485 --> 00:27:22,515
- Raw fish? - Yes.

436
00:27:22,585 --> 00:27:25,685
- Raw fish all of a sudden? - Well, you won the lottery,

437
00:27:25,755 --> 00:27:27,985
so were you just going to keep your mouth shut and move on?

438
00:27:30,155 --> 00:27:32,255
You would steal pennies from a blind man,

439
00:27:32,325 --> 00:27:33,395
you cheapskate.

440
00:27:38,765 --> 00:27:40,665
How am I supposed to feed anyone with that...

441
00:27:44,235 --> 00:27:46,375
- Gosh... - What is this? Is that...

442
00:27:46,445 --> 00:27:48,645
for me right now?

443
00:27:49,875 --> 00:27:53,285
Oh, of course. Would I give it to this dark fellow, then?

444
00:27:54,215 --> 00:27:56,785
Ma'am, congratulations on winning the lottery...

445
00:27:58,285 --> 00:28:00,325
If people hear you, they will think I won millions...

446
00:28:00,385 --> 00:28:01,925
and am set for life.

447
00:28:03,625 --> 00:28:09,365
I only won 1,000 dollars. A measly 1,000 dollars.

448
00:28:09,425 --> 00:28:10,765
If they think I became a millionaire...

449
00:28:10,835 --> 00:28:13,165
and a thief breaks in, are you going to take responsibility?

450
00:28:15,465 --> 00:28:18,435
Anyway, since the lottery ticket I bought for you won,

451
00:28:18,505 --> 00:28:21,075
our family doesn't have to worry about getting kicked out...

452
00:28:21,145 --> 00:28:22,875
and can just live comfortably, right?

453
00:28:22,945 --> 00:28:25,815
Oh, of course. You can stay as long as you want...

454
00:28:25,875 --> 00:28:28,045
and live comfortably for the rest of your life.

455
00:28:28,685 --> 00:28:30,355
Is that house yours?

456
00:28:31,115 --> 00:28:33,525
Instead of blaming someone else's mouth,

457
00:28:33,585 --> 00:28:36,285
I should shut my own son's mouth first.

458
00:28:37,725 --> 00:28:40,225
What should I do with this traitor?

459
00:28:40,295 --> 00:28:42,095
Oh, let's not do this,

460
00:28:42,165 --> 00:28:43,935
and sit down to have a bowl of raw fish...

461
00:28:43,995 --> 00:28:45,495
- while we talk. - Sounds good.

462
00:28:45,565 --> 00:28:48,635
Then, ma'am, should we get farmed, or...

463
00:28:48,705 --> 00:28:50,175
Wait, you prefer wild-caught, right?

464
00:28:50,235 --> 00:28:52,305
- Wild-caught. - Wild-caught, of course.

465
00:28:52,375 --> 00:28:54,345
Gosh, wild-caught. Now, Let's go.

466
00:28:56,005 --> 00:28:57,075
Sit down.

467
00:28:59,985 --> 00:29:02,585
It is savoury, right? It is delicious.

468
00:29:05,255 --> 00:29:07,785
I will buy you wild-caught next time.

469
00:29:08,425 --> 00:29:09,525
Rough scale flounder...

470
00:29:10,355 --> 00:29:12,395
A guy who can't even earn a single penny?

471
00:29:12,455 --> 00:29:14,495
Why would you buy something so expensive...

472
00:29:14,565 --> 00:29:16,195
for a useless old man?

473
00:29:17,295 --> 00:29:20,465
What do you mean, a useless old man?

474
00:29:20,535 --> 00:29:22,965
I mean, who bought you that winning lottery ticket?

475
00:29:24,275 --> 00:29:26,305
If you keep mistreating me like this,

476
00:29:26,505 --> 00:29:28,505
the gigolo who brought the lucky seed will fly away again.

477
00:29:28,575 --> 00:29:32,875
Fly away, then. I won't miss you one bit. Got it?

478
00:29:32,945 --> 00:29:36,215
Mom, why are you doing this again at such a nice place?

479
00:29:36,985 --> 00:29:40,425
Anyway, let's use this to clear away all the bad feelings...

480
00:29:40,485 --> 00:29:41,985
we have had until now.

481
00:29:41,985 --> 00:29:45,155
Here, shake hands with each other. Let's make up.

482
00:29:45,225 --> 00:29:47,725
Come on, shake hands.

483
00:29:50,965 --> 00:29:52,965
With just 1,000 dollars,

484
00:29:52,965 --> 00:29:55,605
why do I feel like I am the only one...

485
00:29:56,235 --> 00:29:58,905
taking a massive loss here?

486
00:30:00,305 --> 00:30:01,845
Please give me a break, ma'am.

487
00:30:02,145 --> 00:30:05,045
I really don't want to be kicked out like this.

488
00:30:07,115 --> 00:30:09,185
Gyu Rim's mother came by recently...

489
00:30:09,245 --> 00:30:11,655
and said she would get us a house in the countryside.

490
00:30:11,715 --> 00:30:13,885
She told me to take all the kids and leave Seoul,

491
00:30:14,185 --> 00:30:16,595
so I was completely devastated and dumbfounded.

492
00:30:17,695 --> 00:30:19,825
Really? Gyu Rim's mother showed up?

493
00:30:20,325 --> 00:30:21,595
Is that true?

494
00:30:21,895 --> 00:30:24,195
Why would she suddenly come and tell you to take the kids...

495
00:30:24,265 --> 00:30:25,865
and leave Seoul?

496
00:30:26,135 --> 00:30:29,105
She remarried a billionaire.

497
00:30:29,505 --> 00:30:31,935
I guess she is afraid we will leech off her.

498
00:30:32,005 --> 00:30:35,045
Maybe I should seriously just go and find her billionaire husband...

499
00:30:35,045 --> 00:30:36,845
and ask him to buy us a house.

500
00:30:36,915 --> 00:30:39,645
Like a two-story mansion in Pyeongchang-dong?

501
00:30:40,185 --> 00:30:42,545
Do not say such nonsense.

502
00:30:42,745 --> 00:30:45,385
- Do you have no pride as a man? - I have no pride.

503
00:30:46,415 --> 00:30:47,985
Does pride put food on the table?

504
00:30:48,625 --> 00:30:50,425
If I had not given her a divorce,

505
00:30:50,495 --> 00:30:52,755
how could he have married such a fine woman?

506
00:30:53,055 --> 00:30:55,865
Just look at Gyu Rim. She is kind. She is smart.

507
00:30:55,925 --> 00:30:56,935
She is great at keeping house.

508
00:31:00,935 --> 00:31:02,235
Actually, maybe I should...

509
00:31:02,305 --> 00:31:05,135
ask for a commercial building instead of a house. Right?

510
00:31:08,375 --> 00:31:10,575
Ma'am, what is the market price for a commercial building right now?

511
00:31:53,955 --> 00:31:56,625
(Daughter)

512
00:32:02,695 --> 00:32:05,495
The phone is off, so you will be connected to voicemail.

513
00:32:05,565 --> 00:32:07,805
Call charges will apply after the tone.

514
00:32:23,185 --> 00:32:26,885
Seo Hyun, I packed a lunchbox for you.

515
00:32:28,155 --> 00:32:30,355
I am at a coffee shop near your office.

516
00:32:30,625 --> 00:32:33,665
Can you come out for a bit and take the lunchbox?

517
00:32:40,005 --> 00:32:41,105
Who is it?

518
00:32:41,865 --> 00:32:42,865
I don't know.

519
00:32:44,335 --> 00:32:45,705
The Chairman is coming.

520
00:32:45,775 --> 00:32:47,645
I told him you are having lunch here.

521
00:32:47,705 --> 00:32:49,375
Why would you do something I did not ask you to do?

522
00:32:54,885 --> 00:32:57,755
Oh, my. I heard this place is good.

523
00:33:01,625 --> 00:33:02,625
Seo Hyun.

524
00:33:04,325 --> 00:33:06,125
I have not eaten a single meal today.

525
00:33:06,695 --> 00:33:07,765
Let's eat together.

526
00:33:08,295 --> 00:33:10,135
Does Go Yoon Hee not even make you meals?

527
00:33:13,265 --> 00:33:14,335
Sit down.

528
00:33:22,075 --> 00:33:23,375
(Seo Hyun, I packed a lunchbox for you.)

529
00:33:23,445 --> 00:33:24,875
(I am at a coffee shop near your office.)

530
00:33:36,995 --> 00:33:39,895
It is delicious. Why are you not eating? Eat.

531
00:33:42,995 --> 00:33:46,165
I will step away so you two can talk.

532
00:33:46,805 --> 00:33:48,035
There is no need to step away.

533
00:33:48,435 --> 00:33:50,205
There is not a single thing here that you should not hear.

534
00:33:51,705 --> 00:33:55,305
Seo Hyun's mental state is like dry firewood on fire right now.

535
00:33:55,575 --> 00:33:59,275
So, to put out the fire, I will stay for a bit and then go.

536
00:34:00,615 --> 00:34:01,615
All right.

537
00:34:05,185 --> 00:34:06,655
I did everything wrong.

538
00:34:07,825 --> 00:34:09,085
I...

539
00:34:09,455 --> 00:34:10,695
was short-sighted.

540
00:34:12,395 --> 00:34:14,195
As a father and as an adult,

541
00:34:14,265 --> 00:34:16,865
I am so ashamed that I can't even lift my head.

542
00:34:18,265 --> 00:34:20,405
I am truly sorry, Seo Hyun.

543
00:34:21,905 --> 00:34:24,275
Well, let's keep this between us,

544
00:34:24,635 --> 00:34:26,435
- Let's just eat for now, okay? - Yes.

545
00:34:26,435 --> 00:34:27,575
Go ahead and eat.

546
00:34:27,975 --> 00:34:30,005
If you are sorry, divorce Go Yoon Hee.

547
00:34:33,375 --> 00:34:34,915
Your mother did nothing wrong.

548
00:34:35,385 --> 00:34:36,785
How is she not at fault?

549
00:34:37,515 --> 00:34:39,515
Giving birth to someone like Han Gyu Rim was her first mistake.

550
00:34:40,125 --> 00:34:41,485
Seo Hyun.

551
00:34:41,555 --> 00:34:43,255
If only that girl did not exist,

552
00:34:43,555 --> 00:34:45,355
if only Go Yoon Hee was not her mother,

553
00:34:45,425 --> 00:34:47,295
she would not have ruined my life like this.

554
00:34:48,825 --> 00:34:50,135
Darn it.

555
00:34:50,195 --> 00:34:52,395
I wish someone like Han Gyu Rim would just disappear from the world.

556
00:34:57,105 --> 00:34:59,275
Is this the kind of person you are, Seo Hyun?

557
00:35:04,075 --> 00:35:05,675
I guess I raised you wrong.

558
00:35:07,545 --> 00:35:08,785
Dad.

559
00:35:09,145 --> 00:35:10,215
Your mother...

560
00:35:11,855 --> 00:35:14,825
No, right, Go Yoon Hee...

561
00:35:15,425 --> 00:35:16,525
tried so hard to raise you well...

562
00:35:16,585 --> 00:35:18,555
that she turned her back on her own biological children,

563
00:35:19,655 --> 00:35:22,195
and she did not even have another child with me.

564
00:35:22,425 --> 00:35:24,665
I don't think she did the right thing.

565
00:35:25,735 --> 00:35:27,565
But you, at least, should not treat your mother,

566
00:35:28,805 --> 00:35:31,005
or Han Gyu Rim, like that.

567
00:35:31,575 --> 00:35:33,275
Are you taking Han Gyu Rim's side right now?

568
00:35:33,335 --> 00:35:35,175
I am not taking sides. I am talking about you.

569
00:35:37,415 --> 00:35:38,715
Is what you are doing right now love?

570
00:35:40,715 --> 00:35:41,985
Then don't do it.

571
00:35:43,185 --> 00:35:45,785
I don't want my daughter to ruin herself and turn into a monster,

572
00:35:45,855 --> 00:35:47,325
so stop with that kind of love.

573
00:35:47,385 --> 00:35:48,385
Dad.

574
00:35:50,995 --> 00:35:52,025
Mu Jin?

575
00:35:52,655 --> 00:35:53,665
Right.

576
00:35:55,425 --> 00:35:57,135
The way I see it right now,

577
00:35:57,195 --> 00:36:00,735
you don't deserve to love Mu Jin, nor do you deserve to be loved.

578
00:36:03,305 --> 00:36:05,175
I am sorry for saying this.

579
00:36:05,235 --> 00:36:06,705
Mu Jin dodged a bullet.

580
00:36:07,305 --> 00:36:08,775
At least that's a relief.

581
00:36:59,225 --> 00:37:00,525
Honey.

582
00:37:00,595 --> 00:37:03,935
If there is anyone you should be sorry to right now,

583
00:37:03,995 --> 00:37:06,135
it's your biological children.

584
00:37:06,195 --> 00:37:07,705
Especially Gyu Rim.

585
00:37:08,165 --> 00:37:09,565
Gyu Rim is the only one.

586
00:37:19,675 --> 00:37:21,545
(Suragan Side Dishes)

587
00:37:41,205 --> 00:37:42,465
Hello.

588
00:37:42,535 --> 00:37:43,705
Oh, hello.

589
00:37:45,405 --> 00:37:47,145
You were here last time, right?

590
00:37:48,545 --> 00:37:50,045
Oh, yes.

591
00:37:50,105 --> 00:37:51,945
We have a lot of delicious side dishes today,

592
00:37:52,015 --> 00:37:53,315
so please try some before you go.

593
00:37:53,715 --> 00:37:56,545
No, I am not here to buy side dishes.

594
00:37:58,415 --> 00:37:59,415
By any chance,

595
00:38:00,825 --> 00:38:02,085
did you eat?

596
00:38:03,185 --> 00:38:06,195
Oh, yes, I had lunch.

597
00:38:07,995 --> 00:38:08,995
Oh, right.

598
00:38:10,265 --> 00:38:11,995
It is way past lunchtime, right?

599
00:38:13,935 --> 00:38:15,635
Did you have dinner?

600
00:38:16,705 --> 00:38:20,175
I am going to eat dinner later when I get home.

601
00:38:22,475 --> 00:38:23,475
Oh, then...

602
00:38:25,715 --> 00:38:27,615
Would you like to have this for dinner?

603
00:38:30,715 --> 00:38:32,885
I made this lunchbox myself,

604
00:38:33,615 --> 00:38:35,885
and I made it really delicious.

605
00:38:37,795 --> 00:38:40,125
You are giving this to me? To me?

606
00:38:42,025 --> 00:38:43,795
Oh, if you feel uncomfortable,

607
00:38:43,865 --> 00:38:46,565
- you don't have to eat it. - Oh, no, please give it to me.

608
00:38:46,635 --> 00:38:48,265
You said you made it really delicious,

609
00:38:48,335 --> 00:38:50,775
so I would be grateful to have it. Please give it to me.

610
00:38:55,275 --> 00:38:57,005
Thank you. I will enjoy it.

611
00:39:32,845 --> 00:39:38,685
How can a person of that age be so immature?

612
00:39:39,285 --> 00:39:41,525
Being that immature is truly a talent.

613
00:39:43,425 --> 00:39:46,855
Someone walked in, and you don't even acknowledge them?

614
00:39:47,925 --> 00:39:49,125
You are here, ma'am.

615
00:39:50,265 --> 00:39:53,295
Where is your mind at, young lady?

616
00:39:56,235 --> 00:39:58,305
Oh my, what is all this?

617
00:39:59,435 --> 00:40:00,705
Someone earlier...

618
00:40:02,205 --> 00:40:03,605
dropped this off.

619
00:40:03,675 --> 00:40:06,075
What? Who is this someone?

620
00:40:09,285 --> 00:40:10,285
Who?

621
00:40:11,885 --> 00:40:13,385
Seriously, this girl.

622
00:40:13,455 --> 00:40:15,825
Why are you spacing out like this?

623
00:40:18,855 --> 00:40:19,925
Is something wrong?

624
00:40:20,995 --> 00:40:22,125
This lunch box...

625
00:40:23,935 --> 00:40:26,595
looks like one I have seen before.

626
00:40:27,805 --> 00:40:28,805
What?

627
00:40:30,305 --> 00:40:31,435
This lunch box...

628
00:40:33,945 --> 00:40:36,045
looks exactly like the one...

629
00:40:37,875 --> 00:40:39,315
my mother used to pack for me.

630
00:40:41,015 --> 00:40:42,515
Don't lie to me.

631
00:40:42,585 --> 00:40:44,985
You ate from a fancy lunch box like this?

632
00:40:45,055 --> 00:40:47,955
Oh, please. Come on.

633
00:40:48,025 --> 00:40:50,185
You said you grew up wealthy, right?

634
00:40:52,495 --> 00:40:54,065
Oh my.

635
00:40:54,125 --> 00:40:55,695
Oh my, this is delicious. Oh my.

636
00:40:57,865 --> 00:40:58,865
What?

637
00:41:00,505 --> 00:41:04,305
This abalone tastes like citron.

638
00:41:10,445 --> 00:41:11,575
My mother...

639
00:41:13,375 --> 00:41:14,945
used to add citron syrup...

640
00:41:16,785 --> 00:41:18,385
when she braised abalone.

641
00:41:23,355 --> 00:41:26,525
That woman who gave you this lunch box,

642
00:41:27,095 --> 00:41:30,635
was she wearing sunglasses? Like a spy?

643
00:41:33,265 --> 00:41:34,265
I was right.

644
00:41:34,335 --> 00:41:37,105
I heard your mother went to see your father too.

645
00:41:37,735 --> 00:41:41,275
That woman must be your mother.

646
00:41:41,605 --> 00:41:46,375
She came by last time and asked if you were Han Gyu Rim.

647
00:41:47,385 --> 00:41:50,045
But why did she just drop off the lunch box...

648
00:41:50,045 --> 00:41:51,715
without even acknowledging you?

649
00:41:53,355 --> 00:41:56,285
If she left just a moment ago, she could not have gone far.

650
00:41:56,555 --> 00:41:57,555
Goodness.

651
00:42:15,975 --> 00:42:18,175
I caught you, you spy woman.

652
00:42:18,245 --> 00:42:19,615
You are Han Gyu Rim's mother, right?

653
00:42:20,785 --> 00:42:22,745
You are Han Gyu Rim's mother.

654
00:42:23,015 --> 00:42:24,455
You have the wrong person.

655
00:42:24,915 --> 00:42:27,285
Take off those dark glasses.

656
00:42:27,555 --> 00:42:31,995
Let me see how expensive and grand your face is.

657
00:42:32,425 --> 00:42:34,225
You visit your child after more than ten years...

658
00:42:34,295 --> 00:42:35,565
and leave without even saying hello.

659
00:42:35,625 --> 00:42:38,995
- Let's see that arrogant face. - What is wrong with this old lady?

660
00:42:39,065 --> 00:42:43,265
- You have the wrong person. - Just like Gyu Rim's father said,

661
00:42:43,335 --> 00:42:46,035
are you worried she might cling to you?

662
00:42:46,835 --> 00:42:48,105
Gosh.

663
00:42:48,745 --> 00:42:51,315
I heard you remarried a wealthy Chairman,

664
00:42:51,475 --> 00:42:53,875
so are you afraid the kids might ask for money?

665
00:42:53,945 --> 00:42:56,445
- Is that what you are scared of? - Seriously, this old lady.

666
00:42:57,015 --> 00:42:59,815
Stop talking nonsense and go to a hospital if you are sick.

667
00:42:59,885 --> 00:43:01,755
If you keep blocking my way like this,

668
00:43:01,825 --> 00:43:03,385
I will call the police.

669
00:43:05,325 --> 00:43:06,425
Oh, please.

670
00:43:08,795 --> 00:43:11,365
You are truly heartless and cold.

671
00:43:11,665 --> 00:43:13,965
How can you stand in front of your own flesh and blood...

672
00:43:14,035 --> 00:43:17,165
and not be able to say, "I am your mother"?

673
00:43:17,705 --> 00:43:19,635
They say blood is thicker than water,

674
00:43:19,705 --> 00:43:22,175
but is your blood made of ice water?

675
00:43:24,515 --> 00:43:27,885
Wow, what a cruel woman. My goodness.

676
00:44:23,535 --> 00:44:24,935
- Gosh. - Are you okay?

677
00:44:30,945 --> 00:44:31,945
What?

678
00:44:33,145 --> 00:44:36,415
You are the student from last time, right?

679
00:44:37,185 --> 00:44:39,655
Yes. Are you sure you are okay?

680
00:44:40,655 --> 00:44:41,885
I'm fine.

681
00:44:43,355 --> 00:44:44,755
Gosh.

682
00:44:45,325 --> 00:44:47,295
I was lost in thought.

683
00:44:50,025 --> 00:44:52,265
If it were not for you, I would have been in big trouble.

684
00:44:54,265 --> 00:44:56,005
Thank you, for both times.

685
00:44:59,905 --> 00:45:01,375
You are Han Gyu Rim's mother, right?

686
00:45:24,895 --> 00:45:28,035
(Suragan Side Dishes)

687
00:45:28,105 --> 00:45:31,805
(Suragan Side Dishes)

688
00:45:31,875 --> 00:45:34,805
How can there be such a cruel woman?

689
00:45:35,575 --> 00:45:39,275
Looking closely, she looked exactly like your mother.

690
00:45:39,645 --> 00:45:41,845
But she denied it until the end.

691
00:45:42,615 --> 00:45:44,985
She is not just your average cold-hearted person.

692
00:45:47,085 --> 00:45:48,085
Mom!

693
00:45:49,255 --> 00:45:51,055
Oh, she is gone, your mother.

694
00:45:53,155 --> 00:45:54,525
Mom!

695
00:45:54,595 --> 00:45:56,495
She can't hear you.

696
00:45:56,565 --> 00:45:58,565
You should have called out to her when she was right here.

697
00:45:59,795 --> 00:46:01,035
Mom!

698
00:46:04,135 --> 00:46:05,505
Right.

699
00:46:05,575 --> 00:46:08,045
You must have wanted to call her so badly all this time.

700
00:46:09,275 --> 00:46:10,845
Maybe if she hears her daughter's voice,

701
00:46:10,915 --> 00:46:14,345
she might come back, so call her even louder.

702
00:46:18,315 --> 00:46:20,585
Mom!

703
00:46:20,655 --> 00:46:21,985
Mom!

704
00:46:23,155 --> 00:46:24,455
Mom!

705
00:46:26,055 --> 00:46:27,565
Mom!

706
00:46:34,905 --> 00:46:37,135
- What brings you here at this hour? - Hey.

707
00:46:37,205 --> 00:46:39,805
- Hello, Mr. Jang. - Yes.

708
00:46:39,875 --> 00:46:41,975
I heard you came, so I came to say hi.

709
00:46:42,175 --> 00:46:43,905
- Have you been well? - Of course.

710
00:46:45,375 --> 00:46:47,475
Well, please take your time and talk.

711
00:46:47,545 --> 00:46:49,915
- Have Secretary Kim cancel my car. - Yes.

712
00:46:55,385 --> 00:46:57,485
Judging by your expression, it is not good news.

713
00:46:59,295 --> 00:47:00,455
Hey,

714
00:47:01,025 --> 00:47:02,695
have you ever met Han Gyu Rim?

715
00:47:04,235 --> 00:47:06,465
Why is her name coming out of your mouth?

716
00:47:06,865 --> 00:47:09,805
Well, it seems Mu Jin...

717
00:47:10,505 --> 00:47:15,245
still can't forget her and likes her, so, well,

718
00:47:15,305 --> 00:47:17,745
do you have any intention of approving of her?

719
00:47:20,545 --> 00:47:23,615
Did Mu Jin catch you doing something wrong? Are you being blackmailed?

720
00:47:23,685 --> 00:47:26,055
What kind of nonsense is that?

721
00:47:26,115 --> 00:47:30,285
- Don't you know who Han Gyu Rim is? - I know. I do.

722
00:47:30,355 --> 00:47:32,695
Yes, as you said, she is a girl who could not even go to college.

723
00:47:32,755 --> 00:47:34,925
But the reason she couldn't go was because...

724
00:47:34,995 --> 00:47:36,165
she had to act as the provider.

725
00:47:36,225 --> 00:47:38,335
She had to earn money and take care of her siblings.

726
00:47:38,335 --> 00:47:40,035
She just literally couldn't go.

727
00:47:40,035 --> 00:47:44,105
Doesn't that mean she is that selfless, thoughtful,

728
00:47:44,165 --> 00:47:46,575
and very responsible?

729
00:47:46,575 --> 00:47:47,605
Hey!

730
00:47:47,675 --> 00:47:48,675
You startled me.

731
00:47:50,575 --> 00:47:54,015
Wow, you really. I knew you were out of your mind,

732
00:47:54,075 --> 00:47:55,315
but now that you are crazy about a woman,

733
00:47:55,385 --> 00:47:56,415
are you completely blind?

734
00:47:56,415 --> 00:47:58,955
Hey, is ruining your own life not enough...

735
00:47:59,015 --> 00:48:01,185
that you have to ruin my precious son's life as well?

736
00:48:01,185 --> 00:48:04,525
- Calm down. - Hey, if Seo Hyun finds out,

737
00:48:04,595 --> 00:48:07,025
you two will be enemies for the rest of your lives.

738
00:48:07,025 --> 00:48:08,795
Hey, we are not talking about me and Seo Hyun right now.

739
00:48:08,865 --> 00:48:10,495
I am talking about your son.

740
00:48:10,935 --> 00:48:13,465
That is the only way Mu Jin will be happy.

741
00:48:13,795 --> 00:48:15,235
Honestly, as for Seo Hyun and Mu Jin,

742
00:48:15,305 --> 00:48:16,535
I am not so sure.

743
00:48:16,605 --> 00:48:18,975
I think the two of them will be unhappy.

744
00:48:19,035 --> 00:48:21,605
Wow, this is driving me crazy. Hey.

745
00:48:22,275 --> 00:48:23,475
Hey.

746
00:48:23,745 --> 00:48:27,275
You used to be a fool for your daughter.

747
00:48:27,345 --> 00:48:28,915
How did you end up like this?

748
00:48:29,815 --> 00:48:31,155
Hey.

749
00:48:31,215 --> 00:48:33,915
Just because Go Yoon Hee took care of your mother...

750
00:48:33,985 --> 00:48:34,985
and cleaned up after her for ten years.

751
00:48:35,055 --> 00:48:37,585
- You are drowned in gratitude. - Hey.

752
00:48:37,655 --> 00:48:41,265
Mu Jin is a wonderful and great kid.

753
00:48:41,325 --> 00:48:43,395
Your son is so great that I want him for myself.

754
00:48:43,465 --> 00:48:44,595
But...

755
00:48:45,065 --> 00:48:49,205
right now, Mu Jin only has Gyu Rim.

756
00:48:49,265 --> 00:48:50,565
You know it too.

757
00:48:50,635 --> 00:48:53,305
You know how Mu Jin has been living for the past eight years.

758
00:48:53,375 --> 00:48:54,845
Because of Gyu Rim,

759
00:48:54,905 --> 00:48:57,375
he gave up everything and lived like that until now.

760
00:48:57,445 --> 00:48:59,075
To be honest, I don't know...

761
00:48:59,145 --> 00:49:00,945
how Mu Jin truly feels about seeing Seo Hyun.

762
00:49:01,015 --> 00:49:03,145
I don't know if it is just out of a sense of responsibility.

763
00:49:03,945 --> 00:49:07,485
Anyway, for Mu Jin, there is only Gyu Rim right now.

764
00:49:08,285 --> 00:49:09,685
You're unbelievable.

765
00:49:09,755 --> 00:49:11,325
Hey, if you try to tear those kids apart,

766
00:49:11,395 --> 00:49:13,895
- you will be punished. - Jang Hoon Tae!

767
00:49:14,395 --> 00:49:15,925
Anyway, you can't stop it.

768
00:49:16,295 --> 00:49:17,795
You can never stop Mu Jin.

769
00:49:18,395 --> 00:49:21,565
You can't stop it anyway, so just accept it.

770
00:49:21,635 --> 00:49:24,105
Do not hurt each other and just accept it.

771
00:49:24,165 --> 00:49:25,975
Delete my number as of today.

772
00:49:26,035 --> 00:49:27,635
If you are going to spout this kind of nonsense,

773
00:49:27,705 --> 00:49:30,275
don't contact me. Got it?

774
00:49:33,875 --> 00:49:35,845
Wow, what a temper.

775
00:50:21,325 --> 00:50:23,465
I made this sherbet myself. It is orange-flavoured.

776
00:50:24,465 --> 00:50:25,495
There is strawberry flavour too.

777
00:50:27,635 --> 00:50:28,935
I like orange.

778
00:50:32,605 --> 00:50:35,445
I'm really curious about why you were so sad,

779
00:50:36,575 --> 00:50:38,445
but you don't have to tell me if you don't want to.

780
00:50:46,655 --> 00:50:48,885
I will not let anyone come in here, so do you want to be alone?

781
00:50:52,495 --> 00:50:54,895
I am so upset because of Gyu Oh.

782
00:50:56,165 --> 00:50:57,525
I am so scared that Gyu Rim will find out...

783
00:50:57,595 --> 00:50:58,835
that I feel like I am going to die.

784
00:51:03,565 --> 00:51:06,235
Can you let me in on what is going on?

785
00:51:09,345 --> 00:51:11,615
Do you remember what I told you before?

786
00:51:11,675 --> 00:51:14,015
I am not taking Gyu Rim away from you,

787
00:51:14,615 --> 00:51:16,245
but I am going to you guys...

788
00:51:16,615 --> 00:51:19,385
to become your older brother.

789
00:51:21,155 --> 00:51:23,585
Can you just think of me as your older brother,

790
00:51:24,085 --> 00:51:26,595
as family, and tell me?

791
00:51:37,205 --> 00:51:39,175
Gyu Seo secretly took these pictures of the stuff...

792
00:51:40,235 --> 00:51:41,905
on Gyu Oh's phone.

793
00:51:46,945 --> 00:51:48,445
Gyu Oh is...

794
00:51:49,985 --> 00:51:51,355
working at a host bar.

795
00:52:01,195 --> 00:52:02,665
He did it for the money.

796
00:52:04,065 --> 00:52:05,365
He had no choice because of...

797
00:52:05,435 --> 00:52:07,065
the medical bills of the person Gyu Oh hurt.

798
00:52:07,135 --> 00:52:08,905
(Ji Yeol's Wife)

799
00:52:08,965 --> 00:52:12,035
Gyu Oh's dream was originally to become a police officer.

800
00:52:15,375 --> 00:52:17,445
I was curious about the people who extorted him for eight years,

801
00:52:17,505 --> 00:52:18,845
so I wanted to know who they were.

802
00:52:20,315 --> 00:52:21,715
Earlier, on my way back from school,

803
00:52:22,715 --> 00:52:25,055
I went to the auto repair shop where that man's wife works,

804
00:52:27,755 --> 00:52:29,325
and the man working there...

805
00:52:30,985 --> 00:52:32,525
said the owner went on a trip to Hawaii...

806
00:52:32,595 --> 00:52:33,995
and is coming back this evening.

807
00:52:36,625 --> 00:52:39,165
Turns out she's not an employee, but the owner.

808
00:52:40,635 --> 00:52:42,835
He's such an idiot.

809
00:52:42,905 --> 00:52:45,135
Getting played by con artists like that.

810
00:52:48,945 --> 00:52:50,575
But if we report them to the police,

811
00:52:51,715 --> 00:52:53,515
I'm worried Gyu Oh might get arrested too.

812
00:52:58,985 --> 00:53:00,255
Where is this place?

813
00:53:15,365 --> 00:53:17,035
Are you dropping off a car?

814
00:53:17,105 --> 00:53:18,575
Are you the owner?

815
00:53:18,635 --> 00:53:20,235
Yes, I am the owner.

816
00:53:24,105 --> 00:53:26,175
Hey, I arrived a little while ago.

817
00:53:29,185 --> 00:53:31,715
It rained all week, so the trip was ruined.

818
00:53:31,785 --> 00:53:34,685
I don't think Hawaii is for me.

819
00:53:34,685 --> 00:53:35,755
Hawaii...

820
00:53:37,785 --> 00:53:40,295
All right, let's go play a round of golf next week.

821
00:53:40,755 --> 00:53:42,365
All right.

822
00:53:49,465 --> 00:53:51,935
Are you glaring at me right now?

823
00:53:56,105 --> 00:53:57,645
Is your husband's name Son Ji Yeol?

824
00:53:59,445 --> 00:54:01,745
- Who are you? - I'm Han Gyu Oh's brother.

825
00:54:02,715 --> 00:54:04,145
Honey.

826
00:54:04,215 --> 00:54:05,215
Oh, honey.

827
00:54:07,785 --> 00:54:10,085
- What is it? Who is this? - Are you Son Ji Yeol?

828
00:54:11,895 --> 00:54:13,595
I heard you needed another surgery,

829
00:54:14,095 --> 00:54:15,825
but you look perfectly fine.

830
00:54:16,465 --> 00:54:17,665
Even went on a trip to Hawaii.

831
00:54:19,835 --> 00:54:20,995
Who are you?

832
00:54:21,535 --> 00:54:22,965
He says he's Han Gyu Oh's brother.

833
00:54:25,205 --> 00:54:27,475
Gyu Oh said he didn't have a brother.

834
00:54:27,535 --> 00:54:30,745
How can you people use the money that ruined a man's life...

835
00:54:31,415 --> 00:54:33,375
to go to Hawaii and play golf?

836
00:54:34,115 --> 00:54:37,015
We didn't go to Hawaii with Gyu Oh's money.

837
00:54:37,015 --> 00:54:38,555
You need to keep your mouth shut, ma'am.

838
00:54:43,385 --> 00:54:44,725
I'm still a patient.

839
00:54:45,355 --> 00:54:47,525
Because of Han Gyu Oh, I still go to the hospital...

840
00:54:47,895 --> 00:54:49,665
and take handfuls of pills.

841
00:54:49,995 --> 00:54:51,865
It's been like this for years.

842
00:54:52,065 --> 00:54:53,695
I should have been the one who hurt you.

843
00:54:55,305 --> 00:54:57,135
Trash like you should've gotten tangled with me...

844
00:54:57,205 --> 00:54:59,005
so I could kill you properly.

845
00:54:59,705 --> 00:55:02,575
Excuse me. Aren't you crossing the line?

846
00:55:02,645 --> 00:55:05,545
- I told you to shut up, lady. - Gosh...

847
00:55:09,345 --> 00:55:12,355
From now on, on behalf of Gyu Oh, I am going to punish you.

848
00:55:12,755 --> 00:55:16,225
How you deceived Han Gyu Oh, how you blackmailed him,

849
00:55:16,285 --> 00:55:19,555
how you ruined and made a mockery of a man's life...

850
00:55:19,625 --> 00:55:22,695
I will expose every single detail and report you,

851
00:55:22,765 --> 00:55:25,635
so you better hire a very expensive and competent lawyer.

852
00:55:27,935 --> 00:55:29,905
- Be quiet. - Han Gyu Oh, that fool...

853
00:55:31,535 --> 00:55:34,805
How could he get his money extorted for eight years...

854
00:55:36,075 --> 00:55:37,645
and never check even once?

855
00:55:42,385 --> 00:55:43,715
You guys have an accomplice, right?

856
00:55:54,255 --> 00:55:56,795
(Crazy Bastard)

857
00:55:58,735 --> 00:56:00,765
What are you doing?

858
00:56:00,835 --> 00:56:02,035
You punk,

859
00:56:02,105 --> 00:56:03,865
what are you doing to someone else's car?

860
00:56:03,935 --> 00:56:05,275
Are you the owner of the host bar?

861
00:56:05,335 --> 00:56:06,335
Who are you?

862
00:56:07,875 --> 00:56:09,345
Han Gyu Oh.

863
00:56:09,405 --> 00:56:10,475
You know him, right?

864
00:56:12,175 --> 00:56:14,985
I heard you're the one who dragged Han Gyu Oh into this business.

865
00:56:15,045 --> 00:56:16,515
You conspired with Son Ji Yeol,

866
00:56:16,645 --> 00:56:18,755
lied about him needing another surgery,

867
00:56:18,755 --> 00:56:20,015
and took bribes under the table.

868
00:56:22,385 --> 00:56:23,925
What are you talking about?

869
00:56:23,985 --> 00:56:25,855
Who is Son Ji Yeol, and who are you?

870
00:56:25,855 --> 00:56:28,165
Me? I'm Gyu Oh's brother.

871
00:56:29,095 --> 00:56:32,535
From now on, I won't let Gyu Oh be played for a fool...

872
00:56:32,995 --> 00:56:35,565
by con artists like you anymore.

873
00:56:37,735 --> 00:56:41,545
From this moment on, if you touch even a single hair on Gyu Oh's head,

874
00:56:41,945 --> 00:56:43,905
you will realise that living is worse than dying.

875
00:56:43,975 --> 00:56:45,645
I will gladly show you.

876
00:56:54,355 --> 00:56:56,425
- Hello. - How have you been?

877
00:56:56,485 --> 00:56:57,625
- Yes. - Where is the manager?

878
00:56:57,625 --> 00:56:59,925
He just stepped out, but he will be right back.

879
00:57:01,095 --> 00:57:02,725
I spoke with him this morning,

880
00:57:02,865 --> 00:57:05,035
and he said the Balang setup came in.

881
00:57:05,095 --> 00:57:06,835
The limited edition.

882
00:57:06,895 --> 00:57:10,205
- That was sold a little while ago. - What?

883
00:57:11,365 --> 00:57:12,905
I said I was going to buy it.

884
00:57:13,105 --> 00:57:16,075
He said you did not clearly state your intention to purchase it.

885
00:57:17,275 --> 00:57:18,675
I said I couldn't tell from the picture,

886
00:57:18,675 --> 00:57:21,175
so I would come in today to see it in person before buying.

887
00:57:21,445 --> 00:57:22,545
I am sorry.

888
00:57:22,615 --> 00:57:25,115
You did not arrive until late, so we thought you were not buying it.

889
00:57:25,555 --> 00:57:28,325
If only you came ten minutes early...

890
00:57:28,325 --> 00:57:31,855
- What? - It sold exactly ten minutes ago.

891
00:58:11,095 --> 00:58:12,595
That is right.

892
00:58:12,665 --> 00:58:15,005
- I am the rice thief. - What?

893
00:58:16,465 --> 00:58:19,535
Why is a man like you wearing those clothes?

894
00:58:19,605 --> 00:58:21,005
Why?

895
00:58:21,075 --> 00:58:22,945
Can a man like me not wear clothes like this?

896
00:58:23,945 --> 00:58:25,675
Those are incredibly expensive.

897
00:58:26,715 --> 00:58:28,045
Did you steal Grandmother Su Nam's credit card?

898
00:58:29,815 --> 00:58:31,445
I broke my savings to buy it. Why?

899
00:58:32,055 --> 00:58:33,585
I will go change out of this.

900
00:58:33,655 --> 00:58:36,125
- Please charge the card I gave you. - Yes, sir.

901
00:58:36,125 --> 00:58:37,325
Those clothes are mine.

902
00:58:38,525 --> 00:58:40,355
Sung Wook reserved them for his birthday present.

903
00:58:40,425 --> 00:58:42,195
Stop talking nonsense about reserving.

904
00:58:42,565 --> 00:58:44,965
Whoever pays first is the owner. What are you talking about?

905
00:58:45,595 --> 00:58:47,495
Don't be like this, and just give it up to me.

906
00:58:47,565 --> 00:58:48,735
You know Sung Wook's personality.

907
00:58:48,805 --> 00:58:50,605
He goes crazy if he can't get what he wants.

908
00:58:50,665 --> 00:58:53,875
Whether he goes crazy or not has nothing to do with me.

909
00:58:57,445 --> 00:58:59,775
- What are you doing right now? - I am putting my spit on it.

910
00:59:00,615 --> 00:59:01,615
Hey!

911
00:59:03,115 --> 00:59:05,915
Since I rubbed my spit on it and spat on it, it is mine now.

912
00:59:06,255 --> 00:59:08,085
How can you wear something so dirty with someone else's spit on it?

913
00:59:08,155 --> 00:59:09,155
Right?

914
00:59:11,225 --> 00:59:12,295
It's fine.

915
00:59:12,955 --> 00:59:14,255
I can just get it dry-cleaned.

916
00:59:18,225 --> 00:59:19,235
Mister.

917
00:59:24,705 --> 00:59:26,305
Smells amazing.

918
00:59:26,375 --> 00:59:28,305
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

919
00:59:33,215 --> 00:59:34,315
I will give you ten percent more.

920
00:59:34,375 --> 00:59:36,485
- Sell it to me. - No thanks.

921
00:59:37,315 --> 00:59:38,555
Twenty percent.

922
00:59:39,355 --> 00:59:40,355
Excuse me.

923
00:59:40,415 --> 00:59:42,785
I heard rumours that the meat here is really good.

924
00:59:42,785 --> 00:59:45,555
- What is the most delicious? - Everything here is delicious.

925
00:59:45,995 --> 00:59:48,225
This new item is also good, so you should try it.

926
00:59:48,425 --> 00:59:49,965
Just order a bit of everything.

927
00:59:49,965 --> 00:59:51,525
The more you order, the better the deal.

928
00:59:51,595 --> 00:59:53,935
- Really? Oh, thank you. - You are welcome.

929
00:59:54,695 --> 00:59:55,805
How's 22 percent?

930
01:00:03,945 --> 01:00:07,445
If he finds out you took it from me, I am a dead woman.

931
01:00:07,445 --> 01:00:08,585
Mister, please save me.

932
01:00:08,645 --> 01:00:10,345
Please save me.

933
01:00:12,215 --> 01:00:16,255
Do ten bunny hops. Then I will give this to you.

934
01:00:16,955 --> 01:00:18,925
You're really testing my patience.

935
01:00:22,665 --> 01:00:24,525
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

936
01:00:28,935 --> 01:00:30,235
Wow.

937
01:00:33,675 --> 01:00:36,345
Wow, this is truly amazing.

938
01:00:36,805 --> 01:00:38,145
Do you want to try some too?

939
01:00:38,145 --> 01:00:39,975
The meat just melts in your mouth.

940
01:00:48,555 --> 01:00:50,285
You leaving? Take care.

941
01:01:02,635 --> 01:01:03,805
That's enough.

942
01:01:05,005 --> 01:01:06,535
You told me to do ten.

943
01:01:07,375 --> 01:01:08,875
You don't have to do ten.

944
01:01:10,245 --> 01:01:11,245
Just take it.

945
01:01:13,975 --> 01:01:15,415
Text me your account number.

946
01:01:18,145 --> 01:01:19,655
I don't need your money.

947
01:01:20,055 --> 01:01:22,425
You're so obsessed with money that you'd sell out your own life.

948
01:01:22,485 --> 01:01:23,925
Why would I take money from a kid like that?

949
01:01:23,985 --> 01:01:26,595
You're ruining the taste of the meat, so get lost. Hurry up.

950
01:01:36,305 --> 01:01:37,765
How pathetic.

951
01:02:17,605 --> 01:02:18,945
I think Gyu Young...

952
01:02:19,215 --> 01:02:21,115
packed all her things and left while we were out.

953
01:02:23,945 --> 01:02:25,185
You're pretty upset, aren't you?

954
01:02:26,785 --> 01:02:27,785
No.

955
01:02:36,225 --> 01:02:39,735
When I'm having a hard time, holding your hand like this...

956
01:02:39,795 --> 01:02:41,135
makes me feel so much better.

957
01:02:43,165 --> 01:02:46,305
Did you have a hard day?

958
01:02:48,235 --> 01:02:50,305
No, it's just...

959
01:02:51,675 --> 01:02:53,475
I think I'll be fine by tomorrow.

960
01:02:55,215 --> 01:02:56,415
See?

961
01:02:56,485 --> 01:02:58,585
I already feel better holding your hand.

962
01:03:05,555 --> 01:03:09,465
Me too. I love holding my Gyu Seo's hand.

963
01:03:12,165 --> 01:03:13,465
I also had...

964
01:03:14,465 --> 01:03:16,005
a really hard day today...

965
01:03:17,465 --> 01:03:20,135
But thanks to you, I'm suddenly happy again.

966
01:03:57,205 --> 01:03:58,915
I don't think we've formally met.

967
01:04:00,775 --> 01:04:01,845
Right.

968
01:04:12,555 --> 01:04:13,725
Hi, Han Gyu Oh.

969
01:04:15,025 --> 01:04:17,295
I'm Kim Mu Jin, and as of today, I'm your older brother.

970
01:04:53,565 --> 01:04:55,665
(Love on the Menu)

971
01:04:55,735 --> 01:04:57,135
- Are you hiding something from me? - Are you hiding something from me?

972
01:04:57,135 --> 01:04:58,935
Give me some time.

973
01:04:59,005 --> 01:05:01,905
- What does that mean? - What did Mom say she'd give you?

974
01:05:02,045 --> 01:05:03,575
- I don't have a mom. - What?

975
01:05:03,645 --> 01:05:04,645
Why, you little.

976
01:05:04,705 --> 01:05:07,615
Fine, Han Gyu Young. As you said, you ruin your own life.

977
01:05:07,675 --> 01:05:09,485
We are done here.

978
01:05:09,485 --> 01:05:12,155
I love that I don't have to see my family anymore.

979
01:05:12,155 --> 01:05:14,255
That's a relief. You and I have the same goal.

980
01:05:14,255 --> 01:05:16,085
Making sure Gyu Rim never cries again.

981
01:05:16,155 --> 01:05:17,655
- Hey. - And that she doesn't get hurt.

982
01:05:17,655 --> 01:05:19,825
I'm not going to you, Mu Jin.

983
01:05:19,895 --> 01:05:21,195
I don't accept that.

984
01:05:21,255 --> 01:05:23,195
Even if you keep rejecting me daily, I'll keep trying.

985
01:05:23,265 --> 01:05:24,795
I'm never letting you go again.

